IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. COLLNQ.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT LOAN-FILE ASSIGN TO WS-LOAN-PATH
        ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
        ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
        RECORD KEY IS LN-ID
        FILE STATUS IS WS-LOAN-ST.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD LOAN-FILE.
01 LOAN-REC.
   COPY "BLN".

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-LOAN-PATH PIC X(200).
01 WS-HOME PIC X(80).
01 WS-LOAN-ST PIC X(02).
01 WS-EOF PIC X(01).

LINKAGE SECTION.
COPY "COLLNQ".

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BK-COL-LOANLIST.
    MOVE "00" TO LL-RC
    MOVE SPACES TO LL-MSG
    MOVE 0 TO LL-COUNT
    ACCEPT WS-HOME FROM ENVIRONMENT "BANK_HOME"
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-LOAN-PATH
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME) "/var/data/loans.idx"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-LOAN-PATH
    OPEN INPUT LOAN-FILE
    IF WS-LOAN-ST = "35"
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF WS-LOAN-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE "35" TO LL-RC
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE "N" TO WS-EOF
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = "Y"
        READ LOAN-FILE NEXT RECORD
            AT END MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF
            NOT AT END PERFORM ADD-LOAN
        END-READ
    END-PERFORM
    CLOSE LOAN-FILE
    GOBACK.

ADD-LOAN.
    IF LN-STATUS OF LOAN-REC NOT = "ACT"
        AND LN-STATUS OF LOAN-REC NOT = "OD"
        AND LN-STATUS OF LOAN-REC NOT = "DEF"
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF LL-COUNT >= 200
        MOVE "37" TO LL-RC
        MOVE "LOAN LIST LIMIT EXCEEDED" TO LL-MSG
        MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    ADD 1 TO LL-COUNT
    MOVE LN-ID OF LOAN-REC TO LL-ID(LL-COUNT)
    MOVE LN-STATUS OF LOAN-REC TO LL-STATUS(LL-COUNT).
